  the hokulea was built with the express  purpose of proving that navigation by  the ancient way was very viable these  canoes could be guided over 2 000 miles  in long distances  they proved that on their very first  voyage in 1976.  what it means is continuation kaleo and  these others they're just like a pinch  of salt as far as the people who know  how to do this type of navigation  you
 

